      "description": "The methodologies core adopts from its own corpus. A method belongs to the layer whose job it describes, so the directory lifts out with this instance and nothing else moves. Core's job is what a folio HOLDS, where it CAME FROM and how much is PRESENT — which is why a document-ingestion method is core's and not the harness's.",
